# LF in the repository and LF in every working copy, on every platform.
#
# This is not a style preference here. The canonical licence text's bytes are load-bearing:
# the published .txt endpoint must hash-match the file in this repository byte for byte, and a
# checkout that silently rewrote line endings would make that hash depend on the operating
# system of whoever last touched the file.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Nothing in this repository is binary, and nothing should become binary without a reviewer
# noticing — a legal text delivered as an opaque blob cannot be diffed, and a draft that
# cannot be diffed is not a development record.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
